:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Mola King (Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''Mola King''' (マンボ王, ''Manbo ō'', ''Lit. '''Sunfish King''''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Survive! Mola Mola! Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 3.5 Update|Version 3.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Mola King
|image = E 151.png
|appearance = [[Survive! Mola Mola! Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 600¢ - 2,370¢
}}

==Enemy==
Another one of the Survive! Mola Mola enemies, this one has a very long range (same as [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]]) but is single target. Deals significant damage, but has quite low health (~3,000).

He is basically a Nyandam with a faster attack animation and much lower health, and due to his Single Attack, he's way less of a threat. If your [[Cat Cannon]] is strong enough, you can simply fire it to OHKO Mola King instantly at lower magnifications. Even then, units such as [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]] can simply tank a hit from him and go in for the kill.

